# Order mail. The order form is the only thing that reads these, and it reads
# them per request — a missing key fails the request, never the build.

# Full-access or sending key from https://resend.com/api-keys. Without it
# POST /api/orders answers 503 and tells the visitor to email us instead.
RESEND_API_KEY=

# Sender for both the work order and the buyer's receipt. Must be an address on
# a domain verified in Resend. Defaults to "ByteVeda Academy <academy@byteveda.org>".
# ACADEMY_ORDER_FROM=ByteVeda Academy <academy@byteveda.org>

# Where the work order lands — this inbox is the order book until payments and
# a database exist. Defaults to hello@byteveda.org.
# ACADEMY_ORDER_INBOX=orders@byteveda.org
